=a$ is *even*.\n\n- If the graph crosses the $x$-axis at $x=a,$ the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *odd*.\n\nIn our case, the graph is *tangent* to the $x$-axis at $x=-1.$ So, $x=-1$ is a *multiple* root. \n\nFurthermore, the graph crosses the $x$-axis at $x=-1.$ So, $x=-1$ has *odd* multiplicity.\n\nTherefore, $x=-1$ is a multiple root of odd multiplicity."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186272219 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1dbaa022-1660-5be4-91ab-784af759e5e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-5$ is not a root of $p(x)$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269516} {:answer/id #uuid "24cd8b24-9e73-52b8-a02a-9840cd802bc7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-5$ is a simple root of even multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269594} {:answer/id #uuid "320c33fc-60b8-5458-882b-1082ddcfbc92" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-5$ is a simple root" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269721} {:answer/id #uuid "dca54469-41aa-56ba-9c9b-3f1b65b61858" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-5$ is a multiple root of even multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186271202} {:answer/id #uuid "fa7a079f-1d99-5fda-a2b8-aa5aa7028de7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-5$ is a multiple root of odd multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186271457}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fa7a079f-1d99-5fda-a2b8-aa5aa7028de7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-5$ is a multiple root of odd multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186271457} :answer-field/id #uuid "4aa8f9ed-0097-570f-88b4-1359fd5e808a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186271645}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8ba404c4-7f5f-5511-97c8-efc933cc3e04" :question/math-academy-id "q-141137" :question/problem "![](images/68/68d11b32744a238fba00c3dc76d1cec6a750e5